WEBVTT

00:30:28.036 --> 00:30:31.756
They have media embedded
with Russian troops

00:30:31.796 --> 00:30:34.556
on the ground in Ukraine.

00:30:34.596 --> 00:30:39.316
Now, publicly, the Chinese
government wants to be seen

00:30:39.356 --> 00:30:42.116
as: “We’re neutral, we like the Russians,

00:30:42.156 --> 00:30:43.356
we like the Ukrainians,

00:30:43.396 --> 00:30:45.396
we still want to work with everybody."

00:30:45.396 --> 00:30:49.756
But the fact is that China
feels no problem

00:30:49.756 --> 00:30:53.196
being publicly completely
aligned with Putin,

00:30:53.236 --> 00:30:57.916
despite the fact that they are invading
a democratic government

00:30:57.916 --> 00:31:00.796
with 44 million people
in the middle of Europe.